        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2025-01-22",
        "text": "DEBATE - The House proceeded with one hour of debate on S. 5.",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2025-01-22",
        "text": "Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 471 and S. 5. The resolution provides for consideration of H.R. 471 under a structured rule with one hour of general debate and one motion to recommit. Also, the resolution provides for consideration of S. 5 under a closed rule with one hour of general debate and one motion to commit.",
